        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5108 Lever With 5002 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe beautiful shape of the Baldwin 5108 Kensington Leverset will add a sense of movement to any space that helps break-up stagnant traditional decor. The 5002 rose has a classic look that adds richness without being showy. This leverset will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5108 Kensington Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Kensington Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5002 Rose Diameter: 1-3/4\" - <b>will NOT cover standard 2-1/8\" bore</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Half Dummy function is handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other lever functions are non-handed.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Kensington Leverset, Baldwin 5108",
                "description": "Baldwin 5108 Lever with 5002 Rosette - The beautiful shape of the Baldwin 5108 Kensington Leverset will add a sense of movement to any space that helps break-up stagnant traditional decor. The 5002 rose has a classic look that adds richness without being showy. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
